    "name": "Nitro Champagne Tower",
    "steam_appid": 2978550,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/0a57e845038a18bf2de5b75826581074.poster.avif?t=1725659056\" width=640 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/0a57e845038a18bf2de5b75826581074.webm?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/0a57e845038a18bf2de5b75826581074.mp4?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Champagne Tower with Glasses Filled with Liquid Explosives</h2>The rules of the game are simple: stack more glasses higher.<br>However, these glasses are filled with liquid explosives.<br>You know what happens if you knock one over, right?<br><br><strong>And don't worry if there's something other than glasses mixed in.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/35dc036168e3dcedebef5e0296c759ba.poster.avif?t=1725659056\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/35dc036168e3dcedebef5e0296c759ba.webm?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/35dc036168e3dcedebef5e0296c759ba.mp4?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 $1,000,000 Debt</h2>For each glass you stack, you'll be rewarded $10,000.<br>This way, you can quickly pay off your $1,000,000 debt.<br>Of course, any extra amount will be yours to keep.<br><br><strong>That is, if you can manage to collect it.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/3b5a414b4f5dcc159886b4711367e723.poster.avif?t=1725659056\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/3b5a414b4f5dcc159886b4711367e723.webm?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/3b5a414b4f5dcc159886b4711367e723.mp4?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Time Limit</h2>This game has a time limit.<br>However, if you stack the glasses above a certain height, you'll get more time.<br>Of course, if you can't repay the debt within the time limit, it's game over.<br><br><strong>So, which is worse: game over or an explosion?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/844a08193b0380e358bccfa84de0b03d.poster.avif?t=1725659056\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/844a08193b0380e358bccfa84de0b03d.webm?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/844a08193b0380e358bccfa84de0b03d.mp4?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Items</h2>For every certain number of glasses you stack, you can choose a special item.<br>These items can increase your earnings or prevent glasses from falling, all aiding your progress in the game.<br><br><strong>Oh, you don't need those items, do you?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/e7a84e0fa49a1d7a480557f9c0a01220.poster.avif?t=1725659056\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/e7a84e0fa49a1d7a480557f9c0a01220.webm?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978550/extras/e7a84e0fa49a1d7a480557f9c0a01220.mp4?t=1725659056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
